00:02:52.725 --> 00:02:56.445
that might relate to friendships, that
might relate to business, that might

00:02:56.445 --> 00:02:59.115
relate to, you know, learning new things.

00:03:00.015 --> 00:03:05.085
If we know more languages, we will
come across more opportunities.

00:03:05.265 --> 00:03:07.665
That was my experience in my life.

00:03:07.755 --> 00:03:12.105
It was through my knowledge of
Chinese, Japanese, French, Spanish.

00:03:13.005 --> 00:03:16.785
Uh, other languages, Swedish, that
I was able to develop my business.

00:03:16.785 --> 00:03:21.105
That's not to say that, you know,
developing a business is the only thing

00:03:21.105 --> 00:03:25.755
