00:03:33.255 --> 00:03:36.945
if there are a lot of opportunities
coming your way, the likelihood is

00:03:36.945 --> 00:03:42.030
higher that some of these opportunities
are going to be valuable to you.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.270
So more languages, more opportunities.

